# What prettier is not asked to touch.
#
# The rule behind the list: prettier owns the code, and nothing else. That is also what happens in
# the other ioBroker repositories, where prettier runs as an eslint rule and therefore only ever
# sees JavaScript and TypeScript.

# Build output. `npm run build` writes these, so formatting them would be undone by the next build
# -- and one of them is a five-megabyte bundle.
admin/assets/
admin/tab.html

# Written by npm.
package-lock.json
src-admin/package-lock.json

# Prose and hand-aligned tables. The help dialog renders these with our own renderer, the column
# widths in them were set by hand, and none of it gains anything from being reflowed.
*.md

# Translations. These are maintained by ioBroker's translation tooling, which writes them in its
# own shape; reindenting them here would only start a tug-of-war with the next translation run.
admin/i18n/
